## 3. Cryptography & Asynchronous Root-of-Trust

* **Symmetric Pipeline:** All sealed entries utilize `HKDF-SHA256` leading to `AES-256-GCM` (round-trip byte-exact; tampering instantly rejected; ephemeral keys are never stored)[span_17](start_span)[span_17](end_span).
* **Root-of-Trust:** Real pulsar catalog values from **PSR B1937+21** ($P = 0.00155780655654\text{ s}$, $\dot{P} = 1.051045 \times 10^{-19}$, $DM = 71.0227$) bind the HKDF salt[span_18](start_span)[span_18](end_span)[span_19](start_span)[span_19](end_span).
* **Performance & Circuits:** Symmetric compute-only MAC safety-trip check executes in $2.64\text{ }\mu\text{s}$, paired with a 60-second rolling `SHA3-256` hash chain[span_20](start_span)[span_20](end_span). Live `Halo2`/`Plonk` zero-knowledge actuation circuits remain strictly design-only[span_21](start_span)[span_21](end_span)[span_22](start_span)[span_22](end_span).

